    "about.title": "About ZRP Social",
    "about.subtitle": "The First Swiss European Social Media Platform",
    "about.p1": "ZRP Social was born from a simple but powerful idea:",
    "about.p1Bold": "freedom of speech belongs to everyone.",
    "about.p2": "In a world where voices are increasingly silenced, we decided to build a platform that puts people first. No censorship. No manipulation. No hidden agendas.",
    "about.p3": "We are proud to be the first Swiss European social media platform, built on the principles of neutrality, privacy, and security. Switzerland's strong legal framework and its commitment to free expression make it the perfect home for ZRP Social.",
